<title>SINGAPORE: Hiap Moh 1996 net profit falls 15.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Hiap Moh 1996 net profit falls 15.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				2.02 vs   2.40</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)			  7.00 vs   7.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		     6.70 vs   8.00</p>
<p>    Turnover				 48.85 vs  58.11</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    0.77 vs   1.01</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)		1.68 vs   1.54</p>
<p>    Exceptional items		     0.90 vs    nil</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	     0.48 vs    nil</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  2.52 vs   3.47</p>
<p>    Tax					 0.98 vs   1.07</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain		    4.07 vs   0.37</p>
<p>    Dividend pay date:   July 15, 1997</p>
<p>Last day books open: June 30, 1997</p>
<p>Note - Hiap Moh Corp Ltd makes and trades paper products.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
